      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASHBY GNOCCHI (4) produced a moderate performance last time when sixth at this track over 520m behind Elsa Above (30.37) in a Grade 4/5. Was in the money prior to that. Should bounce back. FORREST GUMP (6) improved his time on first attempt this course and distance with a 1.3 lengths win in 36.73 here latest. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. GYPSY GRACE (3) is very good course and distance. Latest effort finished 3rd in a Grade 5 on September 12 over 520m at Wentworth Park behind Jock From Ibrox beaten 2.25 lengths (30.47). Suited here and expected to run well. FANTASTIC STORM (1) drops in journey and should be in the mix.",
